@     bitmap (query_equip_zone_bitmap_with_active_flag +
@     query_equip_target_bitmap_default), calls count_set_bits_in_word to count
@     set bits (equip target count), stores result at [0x0201b290+0x4a4].
@   State 0x7f: reads card_id from slot[0] and dispatches across 6 specific cards
@     (Thunder Crash, Enchanted Arrow, Token Thanksgiving, Token Feastevil,
@      Gryphon's Feather Duster, Cyclone Boomerang), calling
@     submit_effect_zone_lp_and_shape_sprites or
@     submit_lp_indicator_with_slot_xor_flag to submit LP sprites.
@ Returns 0 (void via pop{r1};bx r1).
@ 
@ Constants:
@   LP_DISPLAY_STATE_BASE            = 0x0201b290
